<title>UK: Lloyds Chemist year profits fall.</title>
<headline>Lloyds Chemist year profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		23.85		  vs 29.30</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.3		    vs 7.3</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 10.40		  vs 10.20</p>
<p> Pretax		     47.0		   vs 55.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,135.5		vs 1,081.5</p>
<p> Operating result	 57.2		   vs 61.8</p>
<p> Loss on disposal	 2.5		    vs 1.2 profit</p>
<p> Interest payable	 7.7		    vs 7.4</p>
<p> Tax			  15.95		  vs 17.27</p>
<p> Net taxed		  31.04		  vs 38.34</p>
<p> Pay date		   December 4</p>
<p> Div registration date  October 29</p>
<p> Ex-div date		October 21</p>
<p>NOTE - Lloyds Chemists Plc said 1994/95 figures are before exceptional items. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
